{
 "batchId": "b-0475",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_648cd2de98ef91a30642",
   "sourceHash": "648cd2de98ef91a30642df2e2a08361d7fc47e6ed1ebc7b955da1ce8151e542c",
   "text": "然而，副作用极小并不是人们选择阿育吠陀的唯一理由。支持使用阿育吠陀的主要理由之一，是它对各种病痛的全面功效。在许多现代药物未能奏效的情况下，阿育吠陀已证明它能够将其彻底根除；对于复杂的难治性疾病，则能控制其发展速度。阿育吠陀在糖尿病等疾病上表现出了这种出色的抗病能力，它能调节血液中的糖含量，从而有效地加以应对。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'incurable' rendered as 难治性 (refractory) to avoid a 'cure' equivalent per KTAHV language lock. Source contains strong efficacy claims ('total potency', 'completely eradicate', diabetes blood-sugar regulation); translated faithfully without strengthening — flag for Dr. Deepu John clinical review."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2454819215758fdc99ef",
   "sourceHash": "2454819215758fdc99ef9065392b47e6b17a76381e129dc83cd60854cebe069a",
   "text": "Kairali野生动物自驾游 - 探索喀拉拉邦原始荒野",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dfe12a0eee49055122e6",
   "sourceHash": "dfe12a0eee49055122e621eef1407a1738d1b6ab37d3f1e6ff23aaa1bf16d827",
   "text": "通过Kairali野生动物自驾游探索喀拉拉邦的野生动物。走进雨林、老虎保护区和孔雀保护区，同时享受阿育吠陀健康调理与生态友好的游览。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b08f4c4952508e9c8a66",
   "sourceHash": "b08f4c4952508e9c8a665982a12c02f985bba23dbab26a25e0fc135430264234",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗愈村的野生动物自驾游：探索喀拉拉邦的原始之美",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de228c40219a2fdd47dd",
   "sourceHash": "de228c40219a2fdd47ddcec174676befbc909ea97d328ab89fb474d078bb849b",
   "text": "跟随",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment preceding the linked 'Wildlife Drive' name; the 'immerse yourself in Kerala's wilderness' clause is carried in the following fragment (t_b2fe9a17d726b4592de4) for Chinese word order."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b2fe9a17d726b4592de4",
   "sourceHash": "b2fe9a17d726b4592de42dd18efeacd9ed0b8e19c1d2f0929fd830bfc7eedf57",
   "text": "体验，沉浸在喀拉拉邦迷人的荒野之中。喀拉拉邦拥有印度一些保存最为原始的野生动物保护区和国家公园。从茂密的雨林到宁静的草原，这些保护区内遍布奇异的动植物。野生动物自驾游邀您亲身体验这些自然瑰宝，在兴奋、学习与放松之间取得完美平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment following the linked 'Wildlife Drive' name; includes the moved 'immerse yourself…' clause from the preceding fragment."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5b39b864e8db8ddb5927",
   "sourceHash": "5b39b864e8db8ddb5927c6ba01748b74a97d0174731ffe8c02c5d179070a39b1",
   "text": "跟随野生动物自驾游体验，沉浸在喀拉拉邦迷人的荒野之中。喀拉拉邦拥有印度一些保存最为原始的野生动物保护区和国家公园。从茂密的雨林到宁静的草原，这些保护区内遍布奇异的动植物。野生动物自驾游邀您亲身体验这些自然瑰宝，在兴奋、学习与放松之间取得完美平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0877b55f1187a6a307a3",
   "sourceHash": "0877b55f1187a6a307a3673985786c14fc9a7de9e668dbf6420c03c027fd871f",
   "text": "野生动物自驾游亮点：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5343a56f18cf6bbdfec6",
   "sourceHash": "5343a56f18cf6bbdfec6a956c4ccc3c8cd76f5403188e1b83bc9a2d4b3813565",
   "text": "寂静谷国家公园（Silent Valley National Park）：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4cbf28ba39310207ba5d",
   "sourceHash": "4cbf28ba39310207ba5d9dc1a57c257a0bff2cc8e627bbbdd1a6a8da89dd6592",
   "text": "寂静谷是世界上生态最多样的地区之一，以未受破坏的雨林而闻名，这里栖息着狮尾猕猴、马拉巴尔巨松鼠等濒危物种以及众多鸟类。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e26dcbcf641c84f6051a",
   "sourceHash": "e26dcbcf641c84f6051a0b6ea862cc97056d71e78b37f844de59e492f36e8db3",
   "text": "探索其神秘的风景，并跟随向导徒步，揭开它的奥秘。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_522cbc36a1264a0482be",
   "sourceHash": "522cbc36a1264a0482be83db353de0cfce9c428e03f124f2f5819fec150a881a",
   "text": "帕拉姆比库拉姆老虎保护区（Parambikulam Tiger Reserve）：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d2291ef29bd1c3951bbb",
   "sourceHash": "d2291ef29bd1c3951bbbce87536228dcc5a73f518babc649a3bb876c5094c9c0",
   "text": "这里是野生动物爱好者的天堂，您有机会在自然栖息地中看到雄伟的老虎、大象以及多种鹿类。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ccbaaf99522c3de0ed6b",
   "sourceHash": "ccbaaf99522c3de0ed6bbca8dcd92eda2e3152717b9af6a2b6d9846c97db40c1",
   "text": "您可以乘坐吉普车游猎，或在图纳卡达武（Thunakadavu）和帕拉姆比库拉姆水库泛舟，近距离欣赏保护区的美景。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ec171f61c0974b4cca5",
   "sourceHash": "6ec171f61c0974b4cca51096d5a1114801d75501c086cbaf052d823c858e6dff",
   "text": "内利扬帕蒂山（Nelliyampathy Hills）：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe569576c1e6c6e3cce0",
   "sourceHash": "fe569576c1e6c6e3cce0bed1b321009705d827a3379e68e8e647146bc42c8900",
   "text": "内利扬帕蒂山以葱郁的咖啡园和茶园而闻名，这里同样栖息着丰富多样的野生动物。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20a165e3f43263a32a85",
   "sourceHash": "20a165e3f43263a32a85e3ebd4bd4787d6775a2a7660f53f2208dda0854a2f7a",
   "text": "驱车穿行于蜿蜒的山路，饱览全景风光，同时寻觅豹子、印度野牛和色彩斑斓的鸟类等珍奇物种。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2cdbccccd2d1139495a2",
   "sourceHash": "2cdbccccd2d1139495a25ef44d37e24c7a015cd01a92221e4f2fde30e8345c3e",
   "text": "库兰努尔孔雀保护区（Choolannur Peacock Sanctuary）",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a366bafc967876955b0b",
   "sourceHash": "a366bafc967876955b0be2bc111f50e8eb12661b37bb744ed6e70b2581f7a754",
   "text": "库兰努尔孔雀保护区（Choolannur Peacock Sanctuary）：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1efb6b8d65f8a8485d4d",
   "sourceHash": "1efb6b8d65f8a8485d4dc0bcc4149cb4462b0724edefeaab0952cfca5e60076a",
   "text": "这是一处专为印度国鸟孔雀而设的独特保护区，是观鸟者和摄影爱好者的理想去处。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c246fa4269583c794ebb",
   "sourceHash": "c246fa4269583c794ebb85cce4e9a0708e423e1c07a3b01f78532c985343dca7",
   "text": "与众不同的野生动物自驾游",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d289fcfe2ed3db28dd30",
   "sourceHash": "d289fcfe2ed3db28dd305d7ca3b5cb8fe79d73cbea621545ba29f3b8a21b0eea",
   "text": "野生动物自驾游旨在将探险与健康调养无缝融合。无论您是资深的野生动物爱好者，还是充满好奇的探索者，这段深入喀拉拉邦荒野腹地的探索之行都将让您深受启发、焕发活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'journey' rendered as 探索之行 (exploration outing) rather than 旅程 per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0b4b4a2f7fca4e076c08",
   "sourceHash": "0b4b4a2f7fca4e076c08efcc95fc8bf0e7339a56d7752764fed02a83ea742659",
   "text": "主要特色：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1673e679490eea3943e8",
   "sourceHash": "1673e679490eea3943e824e0b1208019cd73084ed79e7acbc48f2b80cb438490",
   "text": "向导陪同游览",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
